To be fair, both of these problems are due to bugs in the official BNF
grammar (as compared to grammar.300), and as such are not jbofihe bugs
proper.  Here they are:

    .i lu broda li'u .ije brode

    lu .ije broda li'u

Both of those should be acceptable (and both result from the same BNF
grammar bug).

